[0.022, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[5G\u001b[1mThe way i\u001b[15G to a pad, done properly.\u001b[22m It runs on the \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mDocks::FlyInbound\u001b[39m stopgap\u001b[82Gfor\u001b[86Gnow.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BI\u001b[5Gonly read the roadmap and the W12 sec\u001b[43Gion of the delivery order. I haven't read the W12\u001b[93Gplan\u001b[98Gitself,\u001b[106Gso\u001b[109GI\u001b[111Gcan't\u001b[117Gyet\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bsay\u001b[7Gwhether\u001b[15Git\u001b[18Gwill\u001b[23Gneed\u001b[28Gan\u001b[31Gengine\u001b[38Gchange.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GSautéed for 14s · done 11:01 am\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mSounds good, but lunch first. Cya!\u001b[39m                                                                                    \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[39m Enjoy your lunch! W12 will be waiting when you get back.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GChurned for 2s · done 11:03 am\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mLets get started.\u001b[39m                                                                                                     \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m  \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mSearched for \u001b[1m8\u001b[22m patterns, read \u001b[1m7\u001b[22m files, listed \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m directory, ran \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mI'm reading the\u001b[19GW12 plan and its code to start slice\u001b[56G1, the Bronze project as a\u001b[83Gsaved Kind::Project.\u001b[104GI'm\u001b[108Gkeeping\u001b[116GOpus\r\u001b[1B  at high effort for W12, since its ledger and rounding work would be risky on a cheaper\u001b[90Gmodel.\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · summary\r\u001b[42C\u001b[2Bthought for 4s)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24