ve\u001b[30Gwhose\u001b[36Gproject\u001b[44Gholds\u001b[50Gthe\u001b[54Gwrong\u001b[60Ggoods\u001b[66Gor\u001b[69Gtoo\u001b[73Gmany,\u001b[79Gor\u001b[82Ghas\u001b[86Gworked\u001b[93Gan\u001b[96Gimpossible\u001b[107Gnumber\u001b[114Gof\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G  steps.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[1mThings to know:\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- \u001b[1mHash pins:\u001b[22m three pinned world hashes moved because every save now includes the region\u001b[91G' new data. Every other\u001b[115Gcheck\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bin\u001b[8Gthose\u001b[14Gtests\u001b[20Gstill\u001b[26Gholds.\u001b[33GThe\u001b[37Gtest\u001b[42Gthat\u001b[47Gfixes\u001b[53Gthe\u001b[57Gsystem\u001b[64Gorder\u001b[70Galso\u001b[75Ggains\u001b[81G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mmanifest.projects\u001b[39m.\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G- \u001b[1mNot run yet:\u001b[22m the full gate (\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m--werror --asan --tidy\u001b[39m).\u001b[58GThe\u001b[62Gplan\u001b[67Gruns\u001b[72Git\u001b[75Gafter\u001b[81Gslice\u001b[87G3,\u001b[90Gso\u001b[93Gthis\u001b[98Gcommit\u001b[105Gis\u001b[108Gunpushed.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bclang-tidy\u001b[16Gis\u001b[19Gclean\u001b[25Gon\u001b[28Gthe\u001b[32Gchanged\u001b[40Gfiles\u001b[46Gafter\u001b[52Gone\u001b[56Gfix.\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G- \u001b[1mRepeat bronze production is out of scope.\u001b[22m The W11 contract only says completion unlocks the recipe. D-029 says who\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  owns the inputs and outputs, facility access and batch timing must be specified before it's built, so I've recorded\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  it as left for later.\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
