[39m system:\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G- A project consumes its inputs once, in the step it holds\u001b[64Gall\u001b[68Gof\u001b[71Gthem\u001b[76Gand\u001b[80Ghas\u001b[84Ga\u001b[86Gworking\u001b[94Gworkshop.\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1BIt then works st\u001b[24Gp\u001b[26Gby ste\u001b[33G, and pauses\u001b[46Gw\u001b[48Gile the workshop is\u001b[69Gut without\u001b[80Gconsuming the\u001b[94Ginputs again.\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1Bs last step\u001b[21Gunlocks\u001b[29Gth\u001b[32G recipe in its own region only, and\u001b[68Gthe\u001b[72Gunlock stay\u001b[84G even\u001b[90Gif the workshop is\u001b[109Glater\u001b[115Glost.\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1BFa\u001b[10Gt-forwarding give\u001b[33Gsame saved state as steppi\u001b[60Gg one step at a time.\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1BLoading refuses\u001b[23Ga save who\u001b[34Ge project\u001b[44Gholds\u001b[50Gthe wrong \u001b[61Go\u001b[63Gds\u001b[66Gor too m\u001b[75Gny, or\u001b[82Ghas\u001b[86Gworked\u001b[93Gan\u001b[96Gimpossible\u001b[107Gnumber\u001b[114Gof\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B \u001b[7Gsteps. \u001b[15G       \u001b[23G \u001b[25G    \u001b[30G     \u001b[36G       \u001b[44G   \u001b[76G\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
