step\u001b[21Gunlocks\u001b[29Gth\u001b[32G recipe in its own region only, and\u001b[68Gthe\u001b[72Gunlock stay\u001b[84G even\u001b[90Gif the workshop is\u001b[109Glater\u001b[115Glost.\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1BFa\u001b[10Gt-forwarding give\u001b[33Gsame saved state as steppi\u001b[60Gg one step at a time.\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1BLoading refuses\u001b[23Ga save who\u001b[34Ge project\u001b[44Gholds\u001b[50Gthe wrong \u001b[61Go\u001b[63Gds\u001b[66Gor too m\u001b[75Gny, or\u001b[82Ghas\u001b[86Gworked\u001b[93Gan\u001b[96Gimpossible\u001b[107Gnumber\u001b[114Gof\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B \u001b[7Gsteps.\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mThings to know:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m- \u001b[1mHash\u001b[10Gpins:\u001b[22m three\u001b[22Gpinned\u001b[29Gworld\u001b[35Ghashes\u001b[42Gmoved\u001b[48Gbecause\u001b[56Gevery\u001b[62Gsave\u001b[67Gnow\u001b[71Gincludes\u001b[80Gthe\u001b[84Gregions'\u001b[93Gnew\u001b[97Gdata.\u001b[103GEvery\u001b[109Gother\u001b[115Gcheck\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gin those tests still holds. The test\u001b[42Gthat fixes the system order also gains \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mmanifest.projects\u001b[39m.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mNot run yet:\u001b[22m the fu\u001b[25Gl gate (\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m--werror --asa\u001b[76G\u001b[39mfter\u001b[81Gslice 3, so this commit\u001b[105Gis\u001b[108Gunpushed.\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
