ove\u001b[74G1.5×\u001b[79Gthe\u001b[83Gfigure,\u001b[91Gso\u001b[94Gthe\u001b[98Glimit\u001b[104Gmoves\u001b[110Gfrom\u001b[115G3.56\u001b[120Gs\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bto 5.25 s, which is\u001b[25Gabo\u001b[29Gt 50% headroom. The extra time \u001b[61Ga\u001b[63Ge\u001b[65Gfrom\u001b[70Gthe\u001b[74Geconomy\u001b[82Gbuilt\u001b[88Gsince\u001b[94GL27,\u001b[99Gnot\u001b[103Gfrom\u001b[108GW12.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mChecked:\u001b[14G\u001b[22mrebuilt\u001b[22Gwith\u001b[27Gthe\u001b[31Gnew\u001b[35Gfigure,\u001b[43Gthe\u001b[47Gtest\u001b[52Gpasses\u001b[59Gat\u001b[62G3.46\u001b[67Gs\u001b[69Gagainst\u001b[77G3.50.\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G- \u001b[1mDocs:\u001b[22m the comment\u001b[23Gon\u001b[26Gthe\u001b[30Gconstant\u001b[39Gand\u001b[43Gthe\u001b[47Gstage-4\u001b[55Gplan's\u001b[62Gslice\u001b[68G3\u001b[70Gnote\u001b[75Grecord\u001b[82Gthe\u001b[86Gnew\u001b[90Gfigure\u001b[97Gand\u001b[101Gwhy\u001b[105Git\u001b[108Gmoved.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BI\u001b[5Gdidn't run the full gate, since only a test constant and the plan changed. Shall I push it, or let it go out with\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bslice 4?\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GCooked for 2m 20s · done 2:30 pm\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[3B❯ \r\u001b[41C\u001b[3B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m← 1\u001b[46Gagent\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
